  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 306056b5c49b6488c91ec00ee567277f, type: 3}
  m_Name: EvilBusinessMan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  dialogue:
  - ' Scram Kid! Can''t you see I''m dumping waste here!'
  - How else am I supposed to mass produce these vapes?
  - Ahhhhhhhh my two favorite things, building my fortune and eviscerating the environment.
  - Look around at all this peaceful nature... really makes me sick! I must inquire
    about building a stripmall here. Yes - that's what I'll do!
  - Gee, I certainly hope no meddling little do-gooder screws up the whole thing
    I got going on here by carefully aligning all these pipes with each other.
  - That would probably clean up the lake or something along such lines. I'm just
    rich though, I'm not a pipe scientist or anything.
  - You're still here kid? Stop listening in on my devious musings! They're how I
    cope with my vape addiciton.
